ice</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.927" end="02:01.211"><span begin="01:57.927" end="01:58.190">And </span><span begin="01:58.190" end="01:59.087">someone </span><span begin="01:59.087" end="01:59.586">way </span><span begin="01:59.586" end="02:00.012">down </span><span begin="02:00.012" end="02:01.211">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.914" end="02:04.944"><span begin="02:01.914" end="02:02.585">Loses </span><span begin="02:02.585" end="02:03.269">someone </span><span begin="02:03.269" end="02:04.944">dear</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.528" end="02:07.421"><span begin="02:05.528" end="02:05.776">The </span><span begin="02:05.776" end="02:06.142">winner </span><span begin="02:06.142" end="02:06.838">takes </span><span begin="02:06.838" end="02:07.088">it </span><span begin="02:07.088" end="02:07.421">all</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.421" end="02:08.962"><span begin="02:07.421" end="02:07.982">Takes </span><span begin="02:07.982" end="02:08.520">it </span><span begin="02:08.520" end="02:08.962">all</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.298" end="02:11.094"><span begin="02:09.298" end="02:09.560">The </span><span begin="02:09.560" end="02:10.145">loser </span><span begin="02:10.145" end="02:10.345">has </span><span begin="02:10.345" end="02:10.537">to </span><span begin="02:10.537" end="02:11.094">fall</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.094" end="02:13.093"><span begin="02:11.094" end="02:11.673">Has </span><span begin="02:11.673" end="02:12.299">to </span><span begin="02:12.299" end="02:13.093">fall</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.093" end="02:14.834"><span begin="02:13.093" end="02:13.330">It's </span><span begin="02:13.330" end="02:14.072">simple </span><span begin="02:14.072" end="02:14.256">and </span><span begin="02:14.256" end="02:14.472">it's </span><span begin="02:14.472" end="02:14.834">plain</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.834" end="02:16.526"><span begin="02:14.834" end="02:15.482">It 